{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the arcade race where every collision is part of the show and every turn can be the last! Participate in dizzying races on monster cars, overcome all obstacles with special skill and dodge other cars that know no brakes. This game is not just a race, it is a celebration of chaos and speed. Control your monster on wheels and fight for the finish line, overcoming gravity, the laws of physics and common sense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Stylized 3D graphics with a vibrant visual style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Insane AI that creates unpredictable situations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- High dynamics and intense races</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Arcade drive and fun at every turn</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680560?t=1745428426","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680560?t=1745428426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680560/55b029f9f454f7d54a6fd18382cd11cf91463fcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745428426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680560/55b029f9f454f7d54a6fd18382cd11cf91463fcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745428426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the arcade race where every collision is part of the show and every turn can be the last! Participate in dizzying races on monster cars, overcome all obstacles with special skill and dodge other cars that know no brakes. This game is not just a race, it is a celebration of chaos and speed. Control your monster on wheels and fight for the finish line, overcoming gravity, the laws of physics and common sense.</p><p c